  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "薄核纪律",
      "items": [
        "core 只做 Model Call → Tool Call → Tool Result → State Update → Continue/Stop",
        "core 不 import memory / skills / sandbox / subagent",
        "可替换单元以 provider seam 注入，不是插件树"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "依赖零环 + 硬执法",
      "items": [
        "机制层只依赖 core 提供的接口与事件，不反向依赖 core 实现",
        "runtime 以结构化 seam 复核 policy：工具层不信任调用来源",
        "policy 不反向依赖工具实现，拦截在事件链上完成"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "事件溯源会话",
      "items": [
        "append-only JSONL 事件日志是唯一真源（session/created … turn/end）",
        "模型历史由 session surface 投影派生，model_visible_iff_recorded",
        "telemetry 只订阅 emit 旁路，不参与裁决"
      ]
    }
